{
  "_comment": "周次匹配契约样本（报告 J09）。Kotlin ScheduleClock.matchWeek 与本文件一致；前端 web/src/App.vue 的 weekMatchOf 必须给出同样结果。expect: match|no|unknown",
  "samples": [
    { "weeks": "1-16", "week": 1, "expect": "match" },
